   "prompt": "Write the Lewis structures for each of the following:<br>(a) NH<sup>2−</sup><br>(b) N<sub>2</sub>F<sub>4</sub><br>(c) NH<sub>2</sub><sup>−</sup><br>(d) NF<sub>3</sub><br>(e) N<sub>3</sub><sup>−</sup>",
